From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pine Drama Studio Authors <authors@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:05:06 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 29/31] pine(L2): a macOS update service that reads a static
 update feed on GitHub

Upstream's client treats only 204 as up to date (abstractUpdateService.ts doIsLatestVersion), which a static host
cannot answer. PineDarwinUpdateService reads <updateUrl>/<quality>/<asset>.json, compares the published commit with
the running one, and hands the feed to Squirrel only when they differ; the decision is electron-free
(common/pine/pineUpdateFeed.ts) and tested with npm run test-node.

